#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:75
msgid "Menu Selector"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:76
msgid ""
"Catch Sticky Menu empowers you with Menu Selector (for desktop and mobile). "
"A basic knowledge of HTMl/CSS is required as you need to pick the right "
"selector for the element you want to make sticky. You can pick which element "
"of your website to make sticky from the Inspect Element option. You can "
"select the sticky element for desktop and mobile menu selector, separately."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:80
#: ../admin/partials/dashboard-display.php:65
msgid "Sticky Background Color"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:81
msgid ""
"Background colors play an important role when you’re trying to highlight "
"something. Likewise, we’ve added the option to select the background color "
"for your sticky menu. Select the background color from the unlimited color "
"palette that best suits your website and its design to make your sticky menu "
"stand out!"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:84
msgid "Sticky Z Index"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:85
msgid ""
"Catch Sticky Menu supports Z Index option. You can add a sticky Z index "
"easily if there are other elements on the page that hide or peek through "
"your sticky element."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:88
#: ../admin/partials/dashboard-display.php:93
msgid "Sticky Opacity"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:89
msgid ""
"With the Sticky Opacity option available in Catch Sticky Menu, you can "
"select the opacity level of your sticky menu. The more you decrease the "
"opacity level, the more faded your sticky menu will look. You can select the "
"opacity as per your preference."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:92
msgid "Enable on Homepage only"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:93
msgid ""
"You can stick the menu either on the Homepage of your website only or on the "
"entire website. Your sticky menu is enabled on the entire website by "
"default. And if you want the sticky menu to be displayed only on the "
"Homepage, checkmark the tiny box right next to the option."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:96
msgid "Lightweight"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:97
msgid ""
"Catch Sticky Menu, a simple sticky menu plugin for WordPress is extremely "
"lightweight. It means you will not have to worry about your website getting "
"slower because of the plugin."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:100
msgid "Responsive Design"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:101
msgid ""
"Catch Sticky Menu, our new WordPress plugin for sticky menu comes with a "
"responsive design, which means the sticky menu trails will look elegant on "
"all devices."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:104
msgid "Compatible with all WordPress Themes"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:105
msgid ""
"Catch Sticky menu has been crafted in a way that supports all the themes on "
"WordPress. The plugin functions smoothly on any WordPress theme."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:108
msgid "Incredible Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-sticky-menu-admin-display.php:109
msgid ""
"We have a great line of support team and support documentation. You do not "
"need to worry about how to use the plugins we provide, just refer to our "
"Tech Support Forum. Further, if you need to do advanced customization to "
"your website, you can always hire our customizer!"
msgstr ""

