#: ../admin/partials/dashboard-display.php:88
msgid ""
"Sticky z-index helps to set the stack order of the element. An element with "
"greater stack order is always in front."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/dashboard-display.php:96
msgid ""
"Sticky Opacity helps to set the  transparency-level, 1 is not transparent at "
"all where as 0 is completely transparent."
msgstr ""

